{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/069-zhong-gu-you-tui/fangyurun-yuanshi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/069-zhong-gu-you-tui/fangyurun-yuanshi/data.json","title":"诗经原始(上下) · 中谷有蓷 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 王風 · 中谷有蓷 · 汇集《诗经原始(上下)》关于《中谷有蓷》的 11 条注释，含 11 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"069-zhong-gu-you-tui","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/069-zhong-gu-you-tui/fangyurun-yuanshi","poem":{"id":"069-zhong-gu-you-tui","title":"中谷有蓷","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"wangfeng","path":["風","王風","中谷有蓷"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"中谷有蓷","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"暵其乾矣","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"有女仳離","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"慨其嘆矣","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"慨其嘆矣","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"遇人之艱難矣","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"中谷有蓷","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"暵其脩矣","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"有女仳離","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"條其歗矣","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"條其歗矣","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"遇人之不淑矣","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-013","text":"中谷有蓷","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-014","text":"暵其濕矣","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-015","text":"有女仳離","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-016","text":"啜其泣矣","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-017","text":"啜其泣矣","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-018","text":"何嗟及矣","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi","title":"诗经原始(上下)","authors":["方玉润","李先耕"],"contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","era":"清","publicationYear":1986,"carrier":"EPUB"},"stats":{"annotationCount":11,"glossCount":11},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":11,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"中谷有蓷㊟閔嫠婦也。","targetNotes":"篇首题注。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 标题段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"题注"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":11,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"右《中谷有蓷》三章，章六句。《大序》謂「凶年饑饉，室家相棄」。《集傳》因之，近是。惟《小序》謂爲「閔周」，未免小題大作。夫一夫不獲時予之辜，固王者之所以爲心，而荒政不講，以致小民流離失所，尤爲東周大病。然遽以此爲「閔周」，則周之可閔者正多也。《集傳》又謂「婦人覽物起興，而自述其悲歎之詞」，閨閣嫺吟咏固自有人，而此云「有女」者，則非其自咏可知矣。杜詩此類甚多，何必定指爲自作？聖人删詩至此，存之以見王政之惡，人民之困，至於此極。則其無以爲國之故，亦大可悲。張子云：「凡天下疲癃殘疾、惸獨鰥寡，皆吾兄弟之顛連而無告者也。」世之讀《中谷有蓷》而無以動其悲憫之懷者，吾亦末如之何也已矣。","targetNotes":"通篇总评原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 总评段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"总评"}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":11,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"蓷〔孔氏穎達曰〕《釋草》云：「雈，蓷。」郭璞曰：「今茺蔚也。」陸璣《䟽》云：「舊説及魏博士周元明皆云菴閭，是也。《韓詩》及三《蒼》説悉云益母。」案，《本草》：「益母，茺蔚也。」","targetNotes":"集释条目。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段分条。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集释"}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":11,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"暵〔孔氏穎達曰〕《易》曰：「燥萬物者莫暵乎火。」","targetNotes":"集释条目。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段分条。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集释"}]},{"id":"0005","order":5,"total":11,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"仳别也，流離失所之狀。","targetNotes":"集释条目。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段分条。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0005-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集释"}]},{"id":"0006","order":6,"total":11,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"脩〔《集傳》〕脩，長也。或曰乾也。","targetNotes":"集释条目。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段分条。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0006-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集释"}]},{"id":"0007","order":7,"total":11,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"歗蹙口出聲。","targetNotes":"集释条目。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段分条。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0007-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集释"}]},{"id":"0008","order":8,"total":11,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"不淑〔《集傳》〕古者死喪饑饉，皆曰不淑。〔姚氏際恒曰〕先言「艱難」，夫貧也。再言「不淑」，夫死也。《禮》，問死何如，曰「不淑」。","targetNotes":"集释条目。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段分条。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0008-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集释"}]},{"id":"0009","order":9,"total":11,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"暵溼〔《集傳》〕暵溼者，旱甚，則草之生於溼者亦不免也。","targetNotes":"集释条目。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段分条。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0009-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集释"}]},{"id":"0010","order":10,"total":11,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"啜泣貌。","targetNotes":"集释条目。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段分条。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0010-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集释"}]},{"id":"0011","order":11,"total":11,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"標韻乾十四寒。歎、難並同。本韻。脩十一尤，叶式竹反。歗十八嘯。淑一屋。叶韻。濕十四緝。泣、及並同。本韻。","targetNotes":"标韵原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 标韵段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0011-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"标韵"}]}]}}}
